From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RicemanRhys <176650384+RicemanRhys@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:08:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Local-only: revert 5c608af (the interpolation's camera
 correction in clip space, twoc step 101's study): never used; twoc step 102
 draws Gold Rush's decals nearer in its in-between frames instead (notes
 18.105). The fixed-function shader and the programs compile as before 5c608af

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
